sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Client
  participant Q as Query API
  participant V as vllm-embed
  participant C as OpenSearch coordinator
  participant S as Data shards
  participant O as Object store

  U->>Q: clips with a trumpet
  Q->>V: embed query text in the same 2048-d space
  V-->>Q: query vector, 15 to 40 ms
  Q->>C: hybrid query, knn clause plus BM25 clause, pre-filter
  C->>S: fan out both clauses to every shard
  S->>S: binary quantized graph traversal, ef_search 100
  S->>S: rescore top candidates with fp32 from NVMe
  S-->>C: per-shard top k, 20 to 60 ms
  C->>C: RRF score-ranker-processor
  C-->>Q: top 50 with visual_vector excluded
  Q->>O: signed URLs for the three played stills
  O-->>Q: URLs
  Q-->>U: ranked segments, p95 under 300 ms
